                <l xml:id="m-ea0d5d0d-9dc3-41fa-877b-44387199576b" facs="#m-a5174e9d-b0d4-4940-bfe3-c9aaea5a0625" label="ambiguous">1296</l><l xml:id="m-0d853a32-811b-4e5d-a740-2ffda51cb5d1" facs="#m-585b6664-41f0-4b27-bd77-a24dd71c0f5f" label="text-like">Mass for the Propagation of the Faith.</l><l xml:id="m-e64d1754-67c2-4ade-bcd6-98fd8674449e" facs="#m-6ba14979-0933-4dea-b78a-298434555562" label="text-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Alleluia, alleltia. Y. Jubi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8665d4fa-646c-4af7-b999-ae977a25cc30" facs="#m-0f583cc8-4544-4f7f-ad16-67fcea7cd1fa" label="text-like">late. is sung instead, p. 1294; and then the following:</l><l xml:id="m-7a23f60c-2581-41f5-849a-de6618779dc2" facs="#m-52191bac-2ce4-4fd2-9d39-7f3470605193" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-89242b02-771a-4f72-bbc1-d430f004e53d" facs="#m-45c2976e-d0d3-48d9-8caa-5f6ef5ebfb8d" label="ambiguous">A ne</l><l xml:id="m-e66478ca-aea0-49a5-a92a-13746b0f2131" facs="#m-ec678760-34af-4976-b7e3-8582afd78b68" label="lyrics-like">lú¬ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0d337207-e246-4ed0-b30a-0b1c8aed28a0" facs="#m-fc4500e8-8706-4a49-94eb-d4db1aab9422" label="lyrics-like">V. Sci-tó- te quóni-am Dó- minus</l><l xml:id="m-13abfcf4-08e9-4c86-9926-2ee7ba74c61e" facs="#m-aa27a06c-5338-411e-b1e4-2a3b02277b7b" label="ambiguous">ipse est</l><l xml:id="m-3fcf7023-93f2-4e60-b8f8-71bce494880c" facs="#m-b16fd5d4-9608-4b7f-be32-7db879311ed0" label="ambiguous">I-psi</l><l xml:id="m-d94ded1e-2a44-4ac0-bc1e-7f4bb0e8c8d1" facs="#m-6fee0c55-ba54-486a-9486-d7bcdfe038d4" label="lyrics-like">Dé- us: ipse fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-362ed05f-c2f2-4a8a-8f77-c6c1d2160ef0" facs="#m-986e8e3d-3021-4439-a639-765e2616ed9b" label="ambiguous">cit nos, *et non</l><l xml:id="m-c67de2c5-507f-441a-8885-19d5dc03847d" facs="#m-26753476-4883-4bff-9cbe-2f0f5195f171" label="ambiguous">nos.</l><l xml:id="m-52640010-c896-48ec-9d32-7834f770381a" facs="#m-2e1fba86-b8a7-4d37-aede-aa4a335a83b6" label="ambiguous">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 9. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-534c7309-be00-46b0-8955-39b8036ad289" facs="#m-fdb0f260-1f12-41da-82b6-0ba4325bc9bf" label="lyrics-like">IN illo témpore: Circuibat Jesus! jacéntes sicut oves non habéntes</l><l xml:id="m-6510d5ce-b490-4a1d-b5a1-519066b2d5b4" facs="#m-c0027ddf-346d-4cfb-840d-49b61057c1f5" label="lyrics-like">Lomnes civitátes, et castélla, do¬</l><l xml:id="m-8320cb3b-59e3-4bc2-8878-fe735d1b7266" facs="#m-287d53dc-633b-4753-978d-f4b876d9cfb5" label="lyrics-like">pastórem. Tunc dicit discipulis suis:</l><l xml:id="m-9533e08b-e046-4e41-91ca-507027497c2a" facs="#m-69395d75-bf98-4ceb-aaca-66ce543c8b08" label="lyrics-like">Messis quidem multa, operárii au¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d1799f6-a552-40b1-bbc5-fa14e643e646" facs="#m-98e63e51-6113-4bfc-b272-f844a5208195" label="lyrics-like">cens in synagógis eórum, et praé¬</l><l xml:id="m-06c45e31-1f14-422b-9e2a-2e7ba2c43bd0" facs="#m-bcdaf5cf-3526-4866-991e-0f2a309e650f" label="lyrics-like">tem pauci. Rogáte ergo Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-98b2e50e-1634-4981-9ee8-9d9f6b906716" facs="#m-88aa59cd-25ee-43bd-9b83-556e11d624f6" label="lyrics-like">dicans Evangélium regni, et curans</l><l xml:id="m-ccea0e38-cffd-446c-af85-dfb72adbf582" facs="#m-82e2f52d-57d2-4065-887b-79ccd056ac10" label="lyrics-like">messis, ut mittãt operários in mes¬</l><l xml:id="m-b03df000-2cde-4e7b-b3a9-a657d20cf6d3" facs="#m-d8c50879-067d-44f8-9bb5-178e30a63a65" label="lyrics-like">omnem languórem, et omnem infir¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8a2b837-d34a-47d5-b84d-c834c8f4e696" facs="#m-d5627d02-2722-49df-9fbe-ceb98f580ce8" label="lyrics-like">mitátem. Videns autem turbas, mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4ab7d7a-cb77-4255-913e-499ae9400232" facs="#m-82570185-dce7-462c-b3b9-3e1e990a5b2f" label="ambiguous">sem suam.</l><l xml:id="m-a4c37787-6249-454b-b325-0ad24514e038" facs="#m-1d55d47a-33b9-410a-87aa-89afd211f39a" label="lyrics-like">sértus est eis: quia erant vexáti, et</l><l xml:id="m-95aff4f1-81fe-4deb-956d-c1f0c4a37727" facs="#m-490f9d9b-d4e6-46e7-9406-77d6d3b09427" label="ambiguous">ofrert.</l><l xml:id="m-13f76b26-ccdc-4403-bc14-847010b63a54" facs="#m-e73bf037-c884-4a84-b261-64dd91243cc2" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-16423c3d-365f-41ee-8cbc-b8187c8d2e79" facs="#m-0323beed-dcb3-4400-b439-f595c2705b7e" label="lyrics-like">AFférte</l><l xml:id="m-fc748ab3-f9c4-4afb-8db1-1ea48756f890" facs="#m-80cb0c71-b0df-40f3-8b12-4002a8c61960" label="lyrics-like">*Dó- mi- no,</l><l xml:id="m-492cac15-e568-44d3-8669-d3c99a1cd010" facs="#m-23a03cdc-0664-4757-a45d-6d097e4a1e37" label="lyrics-like">pá¬ tri¬ ae</l><l xml:id="m-6b04bc3f-f1c6-41c5-a8f6-59bda5e3e512" facs="#m-5f9addf6-5827-4dc4-ab29-7bf2b32ed39e" label="lyrics-like">gén- ti- um, afférte Dó- mi¬ no</l><l xml:id="m-f31a76cb-9cff-4801-b0b2-34dc3bb8eb26" facs="#m-155fd627-432d-460a-b970-f283a12b604e" label="lyrics-like">gló-ri-am et ho¬</l><l xml:id="m-200995b8-6875-4a4d-bacb-ea84dba0256c" facs="#m-5cff7d38-6945-4253-8f13-d395a90c728c" label="lyrics-like">affér-te Dó-mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-47cddc75-a0aa-4b1d-a733-936d3f75c8a5" facs="#m-29f03aa2-76a3-44e0-83cb-aecaca92d171" label="lyrics-like">nó-rem,</l><l xml:id="m-c74c5b8b-a012-4e39-aa08-0085d2a4dbbb" facs="#m-d3e9587d-67b8-465b-a10d-ad2ebbc170d4" label="lyrics-like">no gló- ri-am</l><l xml:id="m-880218a7-5ed1-45b1-b7a1-5308c423c381" facs="#m-2c7b9556-86fb-4c31-b747-365ab8136817" label="lyrics-like">tól- li-te hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3824324d-e5bc-43fb-91d0-3d848d566913" facs="#m-4e2300c2-b542-46b7-a0de-31da4f3ac144" label="lyrics-like">nó- mi-ni é-jus:</l><l xml:id="m-0125426a-59fb-489b-a35c-306cda863c1e" facs="#m-37dca90a-319a-4ccd-be26-bec81df4ed4b" label="ambiguous">sti- as, et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>